                                                "sense_id": "9320df7c-3421-30a2-9285-0a881276a4dd",
                                                "text": "Then came putting on the felloes and what we called riving [/ˈɹɪvɪŋ/] the wheel: this was hammering on the felloes. This was nothing to do with putting an iron tyre on the wheel: we sent it to the blacksmith for that but only after we'd put on the felloes to our satisfaction."
                                            }
